    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Display categories as widget on any of your site widgets areas, can display as list or dropdown, you can exclude categories from display, hide categories that does not have any posts and much more.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload <code>custom-categories-widget.php</code> to the <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code> directory</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; menu in WordPress</li>\n<li>Go to the widget area and place the widget wherever you want in your site</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial Release</li>\n</ul>\n"
